# WearWise environment configuration
#
# WearWise needs NO API keys and NO environment variables to run.
# All intelligence (outfit engine, Style DNA, Buy/Skip, gap analysis,
# packing, weather) is computed deterministically by the server actions
# in server/src/actions.ts from the user's own wardrobe rows, stored in
# the artifact database (see server/src/schema.ts).
#
# Future integrations (Tier 4 — not yet wired) would read their keys
# from server-side environment variables, never from the client bundle:
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=            # future LLM for Ask WearWise
# OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=       # future live weather for the Weather Stylist
# VISION_API_KEY=            # future computer vision for clothing scan / Snap & Style
# FIREBASE_API_KEY=          # future Firebase auth/storage migration
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
